*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : LON0004
*> PURPOSE : LOAN LIMITS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : L.B.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-02-10 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-10-02 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 161
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB LONNIGHT STEP080
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LON0004.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY LON0004C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==IN==.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    *> MAXIMUM LOAN AMOUNT
    05 MAX-LOAN-AMT       PIC 9(9)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM INCOME-MULTIPLE
    DISPLAY "MAX-LOAN-AMT=" MAX-LOAN-AMT
    STOP RUN.
INCOME-MULTIPLE.
    *>  OLD CHECK REMOVED 2004
    *>  IF IN-JOB-TENURE >= 4
    *>      PERFORM 9000-OLD-HANDLING
    *>  END-IF
    *> ESTABLISHED EMPLOYMENT MULTIPLE
    IF IN-JOB-TENURE >= 5
        COMPUTE MAX-LOAN-AMT = IN-ANN-INCOME * 4
    ELSE
        *> STANDARD EMPLOYMENT MULTIPLE
        IF IN-JOB-TENURE >= 3
            COMPUTE MAX-LOAN-AMT = IN-ANN-INCOME * 3
        ELSE
            COMPUTE MAX-LOAN-AMT = IN-ANN-INCOME * 1.5
        END-IF
    END-IF.
